Xodus desktop selection overlay
Copyright 2026 Xodus contributors. MIT licensed; see ../shell/LICENSE.

This overlay selects the separately packaged KDE Breeze controls, window
decoration, Plasma style, icons and cursors. Their authorship and licenses
remain with KDE and are preserved in the installed distribution packages.
The original pearOS package artwork and copyright notices are retained.

Reviewed configuration input: pearos-settings 26.7.0-4.
kdeglobals is checked after apply-shell-identity.sh; other inputs are original
package bytes. Neither account settings nor display device records are reset.

Dependency file layouts:
https://archlinux.org/packages/extra/x86_64/breeze/files/
https://archlinux.org/packages/extra/x86_64/breeze-icons/files/
